"16\" alt=\"附圖\">π"],"a":2,"e":"在△ABC　中<br>∠C＝180°－（∠A＋∠B）＝180°－（60°＋100°）＝20°<br>∵D　為<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r65.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中點<br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r66.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r67.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<br>又<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r68.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r69.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r70.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r71.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r72.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">∠DEC＝∠C＝20°<br>∴∠BDE＝20°＋20°＝40°（外角定理）<br>∴扇形　BDE　面積＝（2×2×π）×<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r73.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r74.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">π","k":["107年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910115","s":"圖為大興電器行的促銷活動傳單，已知促銷第一天美食牌微波爐賣出　10　台，且其銷售額為　61000　元。若活動期間此款微波爐總共賣出　50　台，則其總銷售額為多少元？【107年會考】<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image9.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"190\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["305000","321000","329000","342000"],"a":2,"e":"【解一】<br>設賣出的後　30　台，每台　x　元<br>則賣出的前　20　台，每台（x－800）元<br>10（x－800）＝61000<br>10x－8000＝61000<br>10x＝69000<br>x＝6900<br>故總銷售額＝6900×50－800×20＝345000－16000＝329000<br>【解二】<br>61000÷10＝6100（前　10　台每台　6100　元）<br>6100×20＋（6100＋800）×（50－20）<br>＝122000＋6900×30<br>＝122000＋207000<br>＝329000","k":["107年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910116","s":"如圖，五邊形　ABCDE　中有一正三角形　ACD。若<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r76.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r77.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r78.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r79.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">，∠E＝115°，則∠BAE　的度數為何？〔107.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image10.png\" width=\"113\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["115","120","125","130"],"a":2,"e":"(１)在△ABC　與△DEA　中<br>∵<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r81.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r82.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r83.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r84.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r85.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r86.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴△ABC<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r87.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">△DEA（SSS　全等）<br>故∠BAC＝∠EDA<br>(２)∠BAE＝∠BAC＋∠CAD＋∠EAD<br>＝∠EDA＋60°＋∠EAD<br>＝（∠EDA＋∠EAD）＋60°<br>＝（180°－∠E）＋60°<br>＝（180°－115°）＋60°<br>＝125°","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910117","s":"如圖為　O、A、B、C　四點在數線上的位置圖，其中　O　為原點，且<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r88.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r89.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r90.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">。若　C　點所表示的數為　x，則　B　點所表示的數與下列何者相等？【107年會考】<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image11.png\" width=\"151\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["－（x＋1）","－（x－1）","x＋1","x－1"],"a":1,"e":"∵C（x）向左移　1　單位為　A　點<br>∴A　點坐標為　x－1<br>又<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r92.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r93.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴A、B　兩點所表示的數互為相反數<br>∴B　點坐標為－（x－1）","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910118","s":"如圖的宣傳單為萊克印刷公司設計與印刷卡片計價方式的說明，妮娜打算請此印刷公司設計一款母親節卡片並印刷，她再將卡片以每張　15　元的價格販售。若利潤等於收入扣掉成本，且成本只考慮設計費與印刷費，則她至少需印多少張卡片，才可使得卡片全數售出後的利潤超過成本的　2　成？【107年會考】<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image12.png\" width=\"151\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["112","121","134","143"],"a":2,"e":"設妮娜印　x　張卡片，則成本為（5x＋1000）元<br>15x－（5x＋1000）＞0.2（5x＋1000）<br>10x－1000＞x＋200<br>9x＞1200<br>x＞133<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r95.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴x　的最小整數值為　134","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910119","s":"如圖，I　點為△ABC　的內心，D　點在<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r96.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r97.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r98.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">。若∠B＝44°，∠C＝56°，則∠AID　的度數為何？【107年會考】<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image13.png\" width=\"115\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["174","176","178","180"],"a":0,"e":"在△ABC　中<br>∠BAC＝180°－（∠B＋∠C）<br>＝180°－（44°＋56°）<br>＝80°<br>∵I　為△ABC　的內心<br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r100.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">平分∠BAC<br>∴∠IAC＝80°×<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r101.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＝40°<br>由四邊形　AIDC　內角和　360°可知<br>∠AID＝360°－（∠IAC＋∠C＋∠IDC）<br>＝360°－（40°＋56°＋90°）<br>＝174°","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910120","s":"如圖為一直角柱，其底面是三邊長為　5、12、13　的直角三角形。若下列選項中的圖形均由三個矩形與兩個直角三角形組合而成，且其中一個為如圖的直角柱的展開圖，則根據圖形中標示的邊長與直角記號判斷，此展開圖為何？〔107.　會考〕<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image14.png\" width=\"78\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image15.png\" width=\"124\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image16.png\" width=\"128\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image17.png\" width=\"128\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image18.png\" width=\"124\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":3,"e":"(Ａ)∵四邊形　ABCD　為長方形<br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r107.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r108.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝12<br>在直角三角形　BEC　中<br>斜邊<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r109.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝13（不合）<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image19.png\" width=\"138\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(Ｂ)<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r111.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r112.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝12<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r113.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">必須等於<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r114.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">（不合）<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image20.png\" width=\"129\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(Ｃ)∵四邊形　ABCD　為長方形<br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r116.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r117.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5<br>但在直角三角形　CEF　中，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r118.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝12<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r119.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">必須等於　12（不合）<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image21.png\" width=\"128\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(Ｄ)底面各邊長與側面矩形的對應邊皆等長<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image22.png\" width=\"124\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910121","s":"若小舒從　1～50　的整數中挑選　4　個數，使其由小到大排序後形成一等差數列，且　4　個數中最小的是　7，則下列哪一個數不可能出現在小舒挑選的數之中？〔107.會考〕","o":["20","25","30","35"],"a":2,"e":"(Ａ)若　20　在第　2　個數，則　7，20，33，46（合）<br>(Ｂ)若　25　在第　3　個數，則　7，16，25，34（合）<br>(Ｃ)<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r122.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">若　30　在第　2　個數，則　7，30，　　，　　<br>若　a<sub>2</sub>＝30，則　d＝30－7＝23<br>a<sub>3</sub>＝30＋23＝53＞50（不合）<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r123.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">若　30　在第　3　個數，則　7，　　，30，　　<br>若　a<sub>3</sub>＝30，則　a<sub>2</sub>＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r124.svg\" width=\"42\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r125.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">不是整數（不合）<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r126.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">若　30　在第　4　個數，則　7，　　，　　，30<br>若　a<sub>4</sub>＝30，則　7＋3d＝30<br>d＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r127.svg\" width=\"22\" alt=\"附圖\">不是整數（不合）<br>(Ｄ)若　35　在第　3　個數，則　7，21，35，49（合）<br>故選(Ｃ)","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910122","s":"已知　a＝3.1×10<sup>－</sup><sup>4</sup>，b＝5.2×10<sup>－</sup><sup>8</sup>，判斷下列關於　a－b　之值的敘述何者正確？【107年會考】","o":["比　1　大","介於　0、1　之間","介於－1、0　之間","比－1　小"],"a":1,"e":"【解一】<br>a－b＝3.1×10<sup>－</sup><sup>4</sup>－5.2×10<sup>－</sup><sup>8</sup><br>＝0.00031－0.000000052<br>＝0.000309948<br>∴a－b　介於　0、1　之間<br>【解二】<br>∵a＞b　且　a、b　均介於　0　和　1　之間<br>∴a－b＞0　且　a－b　比　1　小，因此　a－b　介於　0、1　之間","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910123","s":"如圖，銳角三角形　ABC　中，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r128.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r129.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r130.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">，甲、乙兩人想找一點　P，使得∠BPC　與∠A　互補，其作法分別如下：<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image23.png\" width=\"116\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(甲)以　A　為圓心，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r132.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">長為半徑畫弧交<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r133.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於　P　點，則　P　即為所求<br>(乙)作過　B　點且與<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r134.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">垂直的直線　L，作過　C　點且與<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r135.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">垂直的直線，交　L　於　P　點，則　P　即為所求<br>對於甲、乙兩人的作法，下列敘述何者正確？【107年會考】","o":["兩人皆正確","兩人皆錯誤","甲正確，乙錯誤","甲錯誤，乙正確"],"a":3,"e":"(甲)以　A　為圓心<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r136.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">長為半徑畫弧交<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r137.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於　P　點<br>連接<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r138.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，則<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r139.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r140.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴∠APC＝∠ACP<br>設∠APC＝x°<br>則∠A＝（180－2x）°，∠BPC＝（180－x）°<br>假設∠BPC　與∠A　互補，則∠BPC＋∠A＝180°<br>即（180－x）°＋（180－2x）°＝180°，x＝60<br>因此∠A＝（180－2×60）°＝60°<br>∵<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r141.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r142.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r143.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴∠A＞∠C＞∠B<br>故∠A≠60°，即甲錯誤<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image24.png\" width=\"116\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(乙)作過　B　點且與<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r145.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">垂直的直線　L<br>作過　C　點且與<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r146.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">垂直的直線<br>交　L　於　P　點<br>則在四邊形　ABPC　中<br>∵∠A＋∠ABP＋∠BPC＋∠PCA＝360°<br>且∠ABP＝∠PCA＝90°<br>∴∠A＋∠BPC＝180°<br>即∠BPC　與∠A　互補，故乙正確<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image25.png\" width=\"116\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910124","s":"已知甲、乙兩班的學生人數相同，如圖為兩班某次數學小考成績的盒狀圖。若甲班、乙班學生小考成績的中位數分別為　a、b；甲班、乙班中小考成績超過　80　分的學生人數分別為　c、d，則下列　a、b、c、d　的大小關係，何者正確？〔107.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image26.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"208\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["a＞b，c＞d","a＞b，c＜d","a＜b，c＞d","a＜b，c＜d"],"a":0,"e":"由圖可知　a＞80，b＜80<br>且　c＞全班人數的一半<br>d＜全班人數的一半<br>∴a＞b，c＞d<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image27.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"208\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["107年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910125","s":"圖(一)的矩形　ABCD　中，有一點　E　在<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r150.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">上，今以<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r151.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">為摺線將　A　點往右摺，如圖(二)所示。再作過　A　點且與<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r152.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">垂直的直線，交<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r153.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於　F　點，如圖(三)所示。若<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r154.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝6<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r155.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r156.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝13，∠BEA＝60°，則圖(三)中<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r157.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">的長度為何？〔107.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image28.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"376\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["2","4","2<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r159.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">","4<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r160.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":1,"e":"【解一】<br>(１)∵∠BAE＝90°，∠BEA＝60°<br>∴△BAE　為　30°－60°－90°的直角三角形<br>故<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r161.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r162.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1：<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r163.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>又<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r164.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝6<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r165.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r166.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝6<br>(２)過　A　作<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r167.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">的垂線交<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r168.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">於　P　點，如圖<br>∵∠PEA＝180°－2∠BEA＝180°－2×60°＝60°<br>∴△AEP　為　30°－60°－90°的直角三角形<br>故<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r169.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r170.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2：1<br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r171.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3<br>(３)<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r172.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r173.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r174.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r175.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r176.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r177.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r178.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r179.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝13－6－3＝4<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image29.png\" width=\"112\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>【解二】<br>如圖，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r181.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r182.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∠ABA&#x27;　＝2∠A&#x27;　BE＝（90°－60°）×2＝60°<br>∴△AA&#x27;　B　為正三角形<br>作<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r183.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">上的高<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r184.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r185.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r186.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r187.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r188.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r189.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝13－<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r190.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">×6<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r191.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝13－9<br>＝4<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image30.png\" width=\"119\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["107年會考"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05910126","s":"已知坐標平面上有一直線　L，其方程式為　y＋2＝0，且　L　與二次函數　y＝3x<sup>2</sup>＋a　的圖形相交於　A、B　兩點；與二次函數　y＝－2x<sup>2</sup>＋b　的圖形相交於　C、D　兩點，其中　a、b　為整數。若<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r193.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r194.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4，則　a＋b　之值為何？【107年會考】","o":["1","9","16","24"],"a":0,"e":"(１)如圖<br>∵y＝3x<sup>2</sup>＋a　的對稱軸為　x＝0<br>又<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r195.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r196.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1<br>∴y＝3x<sup>2</sup>＋a　與　L　交於（1 , －2）及（－1 , －2）<br>將（1 , －2）代入　y＝3x<sup>2</sup>＋a　得－2＝3×1<sup>2</sup>＋a<br>a＝－5<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image31.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"189\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(２)同理，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r198.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r199.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<br>∴y＝－2x<sup>2</sup>＋b　與　L　交於（2 , －2）及（－2 , －2）<br>將（2 , －2）代入　y＝－2x<sup>2</sup>＋b　得－2＝－2×2<sup>2</sup>＋b<br>b＝6<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image32.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"187\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴a＋b＝（－5）＋6＝1","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910127","s":"如圖，兩圓外切於　P　點，且通過　P　點的公切線為　L。過　P　點作兩直線，兩直線與兩圓的交點為　A、B、C、D，其位置如圖所示。若<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r201.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝10，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r202.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝9，則下列角度關係何者正確？【107年會考】<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image33.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"165\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["∠PBD＞∠PAC","∠PBD＜∠PAC","∠PBD＞∠PDB","∠PBD＜∠PDB"],"a":3,"e":"(１)∵L　為公切線<br>∴∠PBD＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r204.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r205.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝∠1<br>∠PAC＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r206.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r207.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝∠2<br>又∠1＝∠2（對頂角）<br>∴∠PBD＝∠PAC<br>同理∠PDB＝∠PCA<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image34.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"165\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(２)在△ACP　中<br>∵<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r209.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝10，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r210.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝9<br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r211.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r212.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">（大邊對大角）<br>故∠PCA＞∠PAC<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r213.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">∠PBD＝∠PCA＞∠PAC＝∠PBD<br>故∠PBD＜∠PDB","k":["107年會考"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05910128","s":"小柔想要榨果汁，她有蘋果、芭樂、柳丁三種水果，且其顆數比為　9：7：6。小柔榨完果汁後，蘋果、芭樂、柳丁的顆數比變為　6：3：4。已知小柔榨果汁時沒有使用柳丁，關於她榨果汁時另外兩種水果的使用情形，下列敘述何者正確？【107年會考】","o":["只使用蘋果","只使用芭樂","使用蘋果及芭樂，且使用的蘋果顆數比使用的芭樂顆數多","使用蘋果及芭樂，且使用的芭樂顆數比使用的蘋果顆數多"],"a":1,"e":"【解一】<br>設原有蘋果　9x　顆，芭樂　7x　顆，柳丁　6x　顆<br>後來剩下蘋果　6y　顆，芭樂　3y　顆，柳丁　4y　顆<br>∵沒有使用柳丁　∴6x＝4y<br>x：y＝4：6＝2：3<br>令　x＝2r，y＝3r（r≠0）<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r214.svg\" class=\"blk\" width=\"242\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>由上表可知，只使用芭樂榨果汁<br>【解二】<br>∵沒有使用柳丁　∴柳丁數量不會改變<br>〔6 , 4〕＝12<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r215.svg\" class=\"blk\" width=\"161\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴只使用芭樂","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910129","s":"如圖，△ABC、△FGH　中，D、E　兩點分別在<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r216.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r217.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，F　點在<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r218.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，G、H　兩點在<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r219.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r220.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r221.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r222.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r223.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r224.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r225.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">。若<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r226.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r227.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r228.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4：6：5，則△ADE　與△FGH　的面積比為何？【107年會考】<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image35.png\" width=\"100\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["2：1","3：2","5：2","9：4"],"a":3,"e":"∵<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r230.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r231.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r232.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r233.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r234.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r235.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴四邊形　DBGF、四邊形　CEFH　皆是平行四邊形<br>且∠1＝∠2＝∠3，∠4＝∠5＝∠6<br>故△ADE～△FGH（AA　相似）<br>又<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r236.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r237.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r238.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r239.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r240.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r241.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝（4＋5）：6＝9：6＝3：2<br>△ADE　的面積：△FGH　的面積<br>＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r242.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r243.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3<sup>2</sup>：2<sup>2</sup>＝9：4<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image36.png\" width=\"100\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910130","s":"某商店將巧克力包裝成方形、圓形禮盒出售，且每盒方形禮盒的價錢相同，每盒圓形禮盒的價錢相同。阿郁原先想購買　3　盒方形禮盒和　7　盒圓形禮盒，但他身上的錢會不足　240　元，如果改成購買　7　盒方形禮盒和　3　盒圓形禮盒，他身上的錢會剩下　240　元。若阿郁最後購買　10　盒方形禮，則他身上的錢會剩下多少元？【107年會考】","o":["360","480","600","720"],"a":2,"e":"設每盒方形禮盒　x　元，每盒圓形禮盒　y　元<br>由身上原有的錢數可知　3x＋7y－240＝7x＋3y＋240<br>∴4y＝4x＋480<br>故　y＝x＋120<br>因此身上原有的錢數為<br>3x＋7y－240＝3x＋7（x＋120）－240<br>＝3x＋7x＋840－240<br>＝10x＋600<br>即阿郁購買　10　盒方形禮盒後，還剩下　600　元","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910131","s":"如圖，坐標平面上，A、B　兩點分別為圓　P　與　x　軸、y　軸的交點，有一直線　L　通過　P　點且與　<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r245.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　垂直，C　點為　L　與　y　軸的交點。若　A、B、C　的坐標分別為（a , 0）、（0 , 4）、（0 , －5），其中　a＜0，則　a　的值為何？【107年會考】<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image37.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["－2<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r247.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">","－2<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r248.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">","－8","－7"],"a":0,"e":"連接<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r249.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵直線　L　通過圓心　P　點且與<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r250.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">垂直<br>∴直線　L　垂直平分<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r251.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r252.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r253.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝｜4－（－5）｜＝9<br>設兩軸的交點為　O<br>在直角△AOC　中<br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r254.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r255.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r256.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝9<sup>2</sup>－｜－5｜<sup>2</sup><br>＝81－25＝56<br>∴<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r257.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r258.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r259.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>又　a＜0　∴a＝－2<img src=\"img/21300b_y107_r260.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/21300b_y107_image38.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["107年會考"],"d":"中","html":1}]